Personal native Lua configuration

Edit the .lua files in this directory. They are loaded by hyprland.lua after
the matching defaults in configs/. Keep module filenames unchanged unless
you also update their require() calls.

Use UserKeybinds.lua for personal bindings and UserSettings.lua for setting
overrides. Defaults live in configs/Keybinds.lua and configs/SystemSettings.lua.
Check existing bindings before adding a new one to avoid duplicate actions.

Do not run upstream copy.sh or upgrade.sh against this personal configuration.
Review upstream changes separately and apply selected changes manually.
See ../README.md and ../docs/lua-migration.md for layout and maintenance.
